  <s:String x:Key="RunElevated">Run as administrator</s:String>
  <s:String x:Key="RunElevatedTip">Needed only to remap inside programs that themselves run as administrator — Windows silently discards input sent to those windows otherwise. Turning this on or off restarts n52 DejaVu.</s:String>
  <s:String x:Key="ConfirmElevate">Restart n52 DejaVu as administrator?

Windows will ask you to confirm. This is only needed to remap inside programs that run as administrator themselves.</s:String>
  <s:String x:Key="ConfirmUnelevate">Restart n52 DejaVu without administrator rights?

Remapping will stop working inside any program that runs as administrator.</s:String>
